        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xwaylitér Mose a múk haratlintaaór koóm. Na/ay'ín Mose kuri luú/ har afi qoomár slahheeraá tám alaá xwaylarose. Asma na/aay kuna ár naxés a na/oó hhoohhoó' kángw kilá' wa ale. Gawaá adoorihe taa da'ayuutiiká tam hara'ayár waawutmo si'imaawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose sleeme a heé haratlintaaór koóm. Inós qoomár tawa heé úr, iri sií' kuwa garmoó dasír Faraór ateetin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iri tsawdín slahh'amaaye ngiwa slaslay dinkwa nee múk Mungú, ta iwa qwalaala/i ar har qoomár niinawe baraá tlakweemaá wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós gana tsaáhh niqimis nguwa slay dinkwa nee Kristo, a gár ló'wa afhhamít ta daqaari'iimár Misri sleémeerowo. Asma inós gár i harahhifi a qeemuudá' i aluú wa slay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ina yaamaá Misrír wa tláy ar haratlintaao, tam xaraasleemaá waawutmo gaa da'ayuutiiká. Asma ina kumiít ar pihh'uuma adór heé Munguúdá' geetlaákw gu ga/áw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose deelmoó Pasaáka guri gaás ar haratlintaao, muu guri hara'ayín tseere ka sliki gawaá maandár do' nee nahha, as malaykamoodá' tsu/uút na/aá baris baraá múk Israeliwo mingiwa tsuú/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli iri waaraáhh ar haratlintaao ar baraá tla/ángw tlawtá Siria adór yaamaá kaahaár wa ale. Múk Misri adoodá' múk Israeli aa tleéhh kawa iiár eeharto, kiri guú/ nee ma'aay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli koo/ír gixsár Yeriko kana harwediít. Alaá deelo faanqwe koo/idá' iri hú' as haratlintaaoodá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rahabu, /ameenidár tsaatuso'o, sleeme i haratlintaaór koón. Inós kaa gaasiiká dinkwa nee mukdá' aa dee/aanuut. Asma inós mukdá' aa tsee/aaríngw ay guna dahi'ís ar wayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta gár ni malé oo' asma qooma i bu'utaká ar kángw Gideoni nguwa alki/iit, nee oo Baraki nee oo Samsoni nee oo Yefta nee oo Daudi nee oo Samueli nee oo aaruuseero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí a múk haratlintaaór koóm. Inooín waawituú yaamaá hatlá' nguri baaliyé', adór ganaa' ngiri tleehhiyé', ngiri tsaahhiyé' adór al'axweesantá Mungú kara boo/eés. Slám inooín afér direeri ngiri tseegiyé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aslaá xaraaslá' kiri tsuú/, nee slám inooín tana ba/án paangadaá xaraasla'a as mikiwa tsuú/. Inooín a múk slaqootlakwén, aluuwo /uuru nguri slayé' as haratlintaao. Tari slaqwaruusér xaraasl tleehhiít, slaqwaruusér hooma kari gusiisín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameena bahh'alé muk'ín kudá' aa qaatl guna sleér, tinda waasleé/ baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahh'alé kiri slahh'eemiís kángw kilá' wa ale, tam kiri tsuú/, ala kaa slaiiká kiwa ba/amisi asma gár ta slai a waasle/uudá' ak hhoó' kun sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee bahh'alé iiara'aduú niqimis nguna slayé' nee muxta, tam kiri tsegiít ar qutúr, kiri dahamiís baraá doó tseegamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kina tlaquút ar tlaa/e, nee kina siiqiít ar masumenadu, kina iiara'ár nee kiri tsuú/ ar paangadu. Inooín tana harweeriirín tawa tlabaá bee/ángw dahamiisi nee tlabaá aara. Inooín a múk liitlakwén oo ta slahh'eemisi nee oo ta muruú tlákw i tlehhiiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuuká' i harina'aaká mukwí nguwa kona'. Inooín tana harweeriirín baraá xaanxoó muu iwa kahhi nee gawaá tlom'i. Tana hoót baraá mar'o nee baraá boh'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
