        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí sleémeero kuna ya/án nee Mungú as haratlintaaor'ín, ala gadaádá' Mungú aa al'axweés ngaa slay'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú gár ak hhoo' gaa amohhe'eés iimír aáng wa ale as atén. Inós gár i slai a boo/eesár axweesantós inooín makawa i giirín hardahamuuwo ta atene, ala masók an al i hardahaán.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
